    "body": "Thank you for this report. The chord and radius figures make the defect clear.\n\nTriage: `P1`, `effort:high`. An R arc whose radius cannot reach its end point is wrong posted G-code. A control can alarm or cut a different arc. A `P1` is worked before all other work. An agent starts on it now.\n\nIf you can, please tell us what your control does with this block (an alarm number, or the path it cuts in a safe air cut). Please do not attach output from Fusion 360 or HSMWorks: this project is clean-room.\n",
